msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L-⟪k:2⟫La ferme !⟪k:3⟫Comment tu le sais ?!⟪k:4⟫Tu écoutais aux portes ?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B5C8132_C8C1_409C_B893_DB04146A9987
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89578a91000d7b5aea7e4ed2f09b06bd692dc6790fdf8499c03dc5be34fbaa58
#. default-sha256: 5c1bb1bf5008a23755863b20832b410e2643a1a2a4ffc3982301b61b6b59801d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B5C8132_C8C1_409C_B893_DB04146A9987"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And another thing, I do ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ care for the sort of stupid, fantastical tales you "
"women so love to pass around!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, et encore une chose, je n’aime ⟪k:1⟫pas⟪k:2⟫ les histoires stupides à dormir debout que "
"vous, les femmes, vous adorez vous raconter !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_70EA927F_8F4B_4247_AE42_F36AB2F4B422
