#: scenario3:scenario3_A4E6FCF4_294C_4F4B_A592_B044693D09DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3e6e52fbb8f1379db7886cb9f5885104d597947461597a102745ffe08001454
