msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, I mean, I ⟪k:2⟫did⟪k:3⟫ make up a good half of it,⟪k:4⟫but the maid really did "
"hear a sound in the middle of the night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bon, d’accord, j’en ai peut-être ⟪k:2⟫inventé⟪k:3⟫ une bonne moitié,⟪k:4⟫mais la "
"servante a vraiment entendu un bruit au beau milieu de la nuit."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b71783bb6cb829309cb7de4e7ebc7564f7f83135bf37e3bbfc38a699b74a82b4
#. default-sha256: 026f68b7b5a1881f6dfbaaedc61400609e530aafa1cd4915243eb4f1b350d475
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it came from the back hall of this very mansion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didja know, they say it used "
"to be a chapel?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et ça venait du couloir arrière du manoir.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu savais qu’c’était une chapelle avant ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D94ECB6_FD6C_4BB6_9262_5446370A58B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a53dd0b6b46c3eccff368a5c4d8db7882b145fea35116cb3cccbeb7df2face33
#. default-sha256: 189db0651723e7276bc97605db6da927f1eee262210309934ef2d99c09db5ee3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3D94ECB6_FD6C_4BB6_9262_5446370A58B1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Again, I have no interest in you women’s little ghost stories."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫À⟪k:3⟫ nouveau, vos racontars de bonnes femmes ne m’intéressent pas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B689A9F5_9980_449B_8F17_4B428117F228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c57f5ebc1c0c158a6b19a18ad27dccb92d54efb6faec365578e8c7bb14d79aab
