msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria!⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria !⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91711e9bd9112a1d4fb5c2111274e0c62c6c09bb708a05fb991e7cdaf6c962b1
#. default-sha256: b6be3f1211bb3fa46f54eecb265b73f34f5627450bdd9e12b0e9513538ce6e77
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, that said, the rumors aren’t completely unfounded.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This ⟪k:4⟫is⟪k:5⟫ a "
"pretty old mansion, and it’s had a lot of work done on it.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Kinda feels like it’s barely "
"holding itself together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bon, cela dit, les rumeurs n’sont pas complètement infondées.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’est ⟪k:4⟫"
"vrai⟪k:5⟫ qu’c’est un manoir plutôt vieux, et il a subi beaucoup de travaux.⟪k:6⟫ J’ai "
"l’impression qu’il tient à peine debout."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8A81ED2_FE20_44FE_B1D8_A91774CCA311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89494fe89f4b7054ff95b9b8b850e4aad9dc9149a69805f61c5d2446155af76b
#. default-sha256: 57599c44381a594d475d7f6624b1729bb7e33bd16427923b3e947e665b09ef1c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8A81ED2_FE20_44FE_B1D8_A91774CCA311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Like a big old quilt with pieces from all different time periods."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Comme une vieille couette formée de morceaux de différentes périodes temporelles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6f874699a5306eef23fec8ad3a163bfd03e257c9f9ee3a98033f098fc17ab12
#. default-sha256: ae0354cdc7b3219e54ac81788ba2397a74d825f3fa1e3b34dfe1fff527c856b9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The back hall is one of the oldest patches.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There’s a huge window on the far "
"end, and supposedly, there used to be stained glass in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le couloir arrière fait partie des plus vieux.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il y a une grande fenêtre tout "
"au bout et apparemment, il y avait un vitrail avant."

#: scenario3:scenario3_03B616D1_F5BD_4EB4_93EA_963BCFEED59B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dface12505d709d0fe5863fed2e1b417ba5df07ff319f03744f22a2b5d545f77
#. default-sha256: 06679dbd98d9f2e976a4b94f2c5e2ec9fbbb4dad8d4ce549ec46a5b3655db317
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03B616D1_F5BD_4EB4_93EA_963BCFEED59B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a depiction of an archangel, they say.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Such a shame. I wonder when it was "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ça représentait un archange, qu’y disent.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quel dommage. Je me demande quand il "
"s’est brisé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F386BA1D_CBE5_4CC4_8FA1_7CFD890B7DE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e39ac3fabc192dc193133c524cfc8b3c5d067756b3b486df3f769f14b921ce9
#. default-sha256: 3e628d6a3e30b6a2fc2bf8c082b947d7a33ac50cac78a813d735b7107245b4c9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F386BA1D_CBE5_4CC4_8FA1_7CFD890B7DE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If it were still there, I bet it’d be worth a fortune!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫S’il était encore là, je parie qu’il vaudrait une fortune !"

#: scenario3:scenario3_959EFDB9_6DA3_4394_976F_ABA1BD83F487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
